ok - dep02-smoke rejects ordinary /tmp
ok - processctl rejects ready REST without AFS mount
ok - processctl accepts TOML literal/basic listen strings with comments
ok - invalid listen configuration fails before creating a managed launch
ok - processctl refuses mismatched same-binary pid identity
ok - native exit 0 and repeated alias stop retain exact result
ok - native exit 1 and repeated alias stop retain exact result
ok - native exit 124 and repeated alias stop retain exact result
ok - stale, corrupt, missing receipts and failed restart/uninstall cannot become clean
ok - lost supervisor leaves explicit unknown instead of clean stop
ok - SIGKILL propagates exit 137
ok - timeout zero reports failure; subsequent stop observes actual completion
ok - canonical alias locks serialize start, stop and complete restart
ok - timeout zero start cannot create a detached product
ok - bootstrap expiry before go cancels supervisor without launching product
ok - SIGSTOP bootstrap cleanup stays bounded and cannot launch product
ok - post-go delayed publication retains intent and stop recovers original child
ok - immediate startup failure is never ready and removes PID
